## 1. Scope

This license governs the "Enterprise Software": the portions of the Noodle
repository that implement licensing/enforcement and the paid Enterprise and Pro
features. This includes, without limitation:

  - the license verification, gating, and key-minting code, including
    apps/api/app/services/licensing.py and apps/api/tools/mint_license.py;
  - multi-tenancy / organizations, single sign-on (SSO/SAML/OIDC), SCIM
    provisioning, audit-log export, external secrets/KMS integration,
    dedicated runner pools, advanced RBAC, and any successor features; and
  - any file that carries a "Noodle Enterprise" notice or resides under an
